### Works in VS Code (REST Client extension) and IntelliJ. Start the app first.
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Demo group (seeded on first start)
GET {{base}}/groups/1

### Who owes what
GET {{base}}/groups/1/balances

### Smart settle-up plan
GET {{base}}/groups/1/settlements/suggested

### Full history
GET {{base}}/groups/1/ledger

### Create a new group
POST {{base}}/groups
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Flatmates", "members": ["Zain", "Hira", "Bilal"] }

### Add an expense (percentage split), safe to retry thanks to Idempotency-Key
POST {{base}}/groups/1/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: dinner-001

{
  "description": "Team dinner",
  "amount": 4500.00,
  "paidBy": 1,
  "splitType": "PERCENTAGE",
  "splits": [
    { "memberId": 1, "value": 50 },
    { "memberId": 2, "value": 25 },
    { "memberId": 3, "value": 25 }
  ]
}

### Deliberately invalid (percentages total 90): expect 422
POST {{base}}/groups/1/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Bad split",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "paidBy": 1,
  "splitType": "PERCENTAGE",
  "splits": [ { "memberId": 1, "value": 50 }, { "memberId": 2, "value": 40 } ]
}

### Record a payment
POST {{base}}/groups/1/settlements
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromMemberId": 2, "toMemberId": 1, "amount": 1000.00 }
